      "content": "Platform must be able to create workspaces. A workspace is defined be one or more tools accessible by web.\nWoekspaces must be isolated from each other.\nWorkspaces will be defined using a docker-compose file.\nAll apps in the workspace must be accessed by its own http or tcp port.\nMultiple workspaces can use same ports so we must ensure we can route requests to the right port.\n\nWe must discuss:\n * Structure to manage workspaces: data, crud operations\n * Workspaces setup (will be using docker)\n * Workspaces routing and user permissions",
